      "body": "I have: \n\n\"modules-center\": [\"hyprland/workspaces\"], \n\n\n\"hyprland/workspaces\": {\n\t\"disable-click\": true,\n\t\"active-only\": false,\n\t\"all-outputs\": true,\n\t\"format\": \"{icon}\",\n\t\"show-special\": false,\n\t\"on-click\": \"activate\",\n\t\"on-scroll-up\": \"hyprctl dispatch workspace e+1\",\n\t\"on-scroll-down\": \"hyprctl dispatch workspace e-1\",\n    \"persistent-workspaces\": {\n      \"*\": 5\n\t},\n\t\"format-icons\": {\n\t\t\"active\": \"\",\n\t\t\"default\": \"\",\n\t},\n},\n\n\n\nThe disable-click flag does not disable clicking of waybar menu after reload.",
