      "body": "**hyprland**:\r\n![screenshot-2023-11-26-18:25:33](https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/assets/25499721/816677a9-9050-4a52-8cb4-d4bcaaedb288)\r\n\r\n**sway**:\r\n![screenshot-2023-11-26-18:23:12](https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/assets/25499721/b9664604-f560-4db2-823c-0b8979f275d1)\r\n\r\n**sway-config**:\r\n```json\r\n\"sway/workspaces\": {\r\n    \"disable-scroll\": true,\r\n    \"active-only\": false,\r\n    \"all-outputs\": false,\r\n    \"on-click\": \"activate\",\r\n    \"sort-by-number\": true,\r\n    \"persistent-workspaces\": {\r\n      \"1\": [],\r\n      \"2\": [],\r\n      \"3\": [],\r\n      \"4\": [],\r\n      \"5\": []\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\n**hyprland-config**:\r\n```json\r\n\"hyprland/workspaces\": {\r\n    \"disable-scroll\": true,\r\n    \"active-only\": false,\r\n    \"all-outputs\": false,\r\n    \"on-click\": \"activate\",\r\n    \"sort-by-number\": true,\r\n    \"persistent-workspaces\": {\r\n      \"1\": [],\r\n      \"2\": [],\r\n      \"3\": [],\r\n      \"4\": [],\r\n      \"5\": []\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith the basically same config I have different results. I expect the behaviour in sway to be the same, but the following inconsitencies occur:\r\n1. All 5 workspaces should be displayed on both monitors all the time\r\n2. The current workspace should be highlighted as on hyprland\r\n3. The width of the workspace buttons is not as configured in style.css\r\n\r\n## System Info\r\n**OS**: Artix Linux\r\n**waybar version**: 0.9.24",
