      "body": "When using [named workspaces in Hyprland](https://wiki.hyprland.org/Configuring/Dispatchers/#workspaces), it would be nice to be able to choose a custom order different than alphabetic. \n\nSpecifically, I have some of my workspaces on Q-W-E-R-T, which I press with the left hand. In my mind, they are ordered the way they are located on the keyboard (Q -> W -> E -> R -> T), but Waybar shows them in alphabetic order:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efb130f4-ba90-45ca-a7db-35038aa32bd5)",
