      "body": "After the update to 0.10.4 on Arch Linux, persistent workspaces setting on hyprland is completely ignored. No errors are reported when running waybar from the command line. Sample settings:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  \"hyprland/workspaces\": {\r\n        \"format\": \"{name}\",\r\n        \"persistent_workspaces\": {\r\n            \"eDP-1\": [ 1, 2, 3 ],\r\n            \"HDMI-A-1\": [ 4, 5, 6 ],\r\n        }\r\n    },\r\n```",
