        "total_blocked_by": 0,
        "blocking": 0,
        "total_blocking": 0
      },
      "body": "The current implementation only implements a-priori filtering (ignore regex, ignore all special workspaces), there's no way to implment any more dynamic filtering, like active-only or #3064.\r\n\r\nThere are two ways to fix this regression:\r\n- Go back to creating the entire workspace vector at every update\r\n- Have a drawn vector with only workspaces post-filter and a storage vector with all the workspaces",
