      "body": "This would make the behavior consistent with sway/workspaces and wlr/workspaces. A config like this:\r\n```json\r\n\"hyprland/workspaces\": {\r\n    \"disable-scroll\": true,\r\n    \"active-only\": false,\r\n    \"all-outputs\": false,\r\n    \"on-click\": \"activate\",\r\n    \"sort-by-number\": true,\r\n    \"persistent_workspaces\": {\r\n      \"1\": [],\r\n      \"2\": [],\r\n      \"3\": [],\r\n      \"4\": [],\r\n      \"5\": []\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nWould show workspaces 1 - 5 on all outputs.",
